B.Yz=new A.k9("Three of a kind","Same figurines stack, three to a cell. Tap a full stack and press MERGE, right under it, to squash them into one random figurine from the next tier up. Merging is how you get strong.","next")
B.YD=new A.k9("Move them about","Drag a figurine onto another cell to swap them. Cells next to the path see the most action, so put your best ones there.","next")
B.YC=new A.k9("Luck and grease","Tea leaves come every fifth wave and from bosses. GAMBLE them for rare figurines. UPGRADE makes a whole tier hit harder. MYTHICS shows the recipes for the four legends of the Rift.","next")
B.YE=new A.k9("Bosses","Every 10th wave a boss turns up, and you have 60 seconds to get rid of it. Wave 50 brings the level's final boss. Beat it and the Rift drags you somewhere deeper. Good luck, love.","next")
